KEHTI HAI RORO KAR YEH MAA AAYE MERA ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
DHOOND NE MAI JAO KAHA AAYE MERA ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
<br>
1. LOORI SUNAO MAI KISE JHULA JULAO MAI KISE <br>
 DHOOD PILAO MAI KISE BETA PUKARU MAI KISE<br>
 NAZRAO SE TU KYUN HAI NEHA'N....AAYE MERE ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
<br>
2. QALB THA KYA FOULAD KA REHAM NA KHAYA HURMALA <br>
 TEER SE US MASOOM KA PYAASA HI CHE'DA HAI GALA<br>
 ISPE HAI SHAHID AASMAA'N....AAYE MERE ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
<br>
3. HASLIYOUN WALE SHEER QAAR GOAD KE PAALE SHEER QAAR<br>
 RAAJ DULAARE SHEER QAAR DIL KE SAHARE SHEER QAAR <br>
 KARBAL MAI RAHA TU NEEM JAA'N....AAYE MERE ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN <br>
 <br>
4. SHAAM SAVERE ROOTI HOON MOU AASHKOUN SE DHOOTI HOON<br>
 RANJ MEIN HAR DUM JEETI HOON HAR LAMHA GHAM SEHTI HOON<br>
 HAI QALB O JIGAR SE KHOON RAWA'N....AAYE MERE ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
<br>
5. SHASMAHA MUJAHID RAN MEIN LADA DUNIYA NE DEKHA NA SUNA<br>
 PAR DHASTE BALA KE JUNGLE MEIN EK HAQ KA SIPAHI AAN LADA<br>
 MAAR KIYA TUNE WOH MAIDA'N....AAYE MERE ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
<br>
6. AAYE MUSTAFA DEKHO HAAL MERA MEHSAR SE HI PEHLE HUM<br>
 QURBANIYE ASGHAR SE HAQ KA YEH DEEN BACHA <br>
 ISLAAM SEH LOONGI GIRE KOH E GIRAIN....AAYE MERE ASGHAR BE ZUBAAN<br>
<br>
 AZZ...MUSTAFA QAARI<br>
